<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy — ImgFeel" description="ImgFeel privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data and protect your privacy." canonicalUrl="https://imgfeel.com/privacy-policy/">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 1, 2025</p>

  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>ImgFeel is a browser-based image tool. Your images are processed entirely on your device using your browser's built-in capabilities. We do not upload, store, or access your images in any way.</p>

  <h2>Image Processing</h2>
  <p>All image processing on ImgFeel happens client-side in your web browser. Your images never leave your device. We have no servers that receive, process, or store user images. When you close your browser tab, all image data is removed from memory.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect anonymous, aggregated usage data to improve our service, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Pages visited and general usage patterns</li>
    <li>Browser type and version</li>
    <li>Device type (mobile, tablet, desktop)</li>
    <li>Country of origin (via IP geolocation, not stored individually)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not collect personally identifiable information unless you voluntarily provide it (e.g., by contacting us via email).</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>ImgFeel may use cookies for basic functionality and analytics. Please see our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>We may use third-party analytics services to understand how our website is used. These services may collect anonymous data about your visit. We do not share personal data with third parties.</p>

  <h2>Data Security</h2>
  <p>Since your images are processed entirely in your browser and never transmitted to our servers, there is no risk of your image data being intercepted, stored, or breached on our end.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@imgfeel.com">contact@imgfeel.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
